{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_page_title":true,"heading_align":"text-center"}},"anniversary_9th_banner_a4hkjR":{"type":"anniversary-9th-banner","name":"9th Anniversary Banner","settings":{}},"anniversary_9th_join_MaANV8":{"type":"anniversary-9th-join","name":"9th Anniversary Join","settings":{}},"anniversary_9th_ninja_y94BAV":{"type":"anniversary-9th-ninja","name":"9th Anniversary Ninja","settings":{}},"pop_up_slider_ikLHng":{"type":"pop-up-slider","blocks":{"popup_wLNarj":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/original.webp","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"Todd’s Electric Blue Menagerie!","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>My new Monument Grill is amazingly beautiful and a wonderful addition to my Electric Blue Menagerie of “Dad Toys”! We just refinished our back patio and I had been patiently waiting to replace my old girl with something new and exciting! <\/p><p>Thanks so much for making this grill available! I can’t wait to use it for the first time on Father’s Day! <\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_Rekyah":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/o.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"The Heat. The Aroma. The Moment.","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>A dairy farmer from West-Central Minnesota, he spends his days caring for 16-18 milk cows with his wife, selling fresh, raw milk. But come Friday evenings, he switches gears, firing up his Monument grill for their weekly get-together with friends.<\/p><p>This time, he decided to test out the new grill. With carrots and potatoes on the cast iron griddle, and lean, grassfed beef patties sizzling on the grates, the evening was set for a memorable meal. Using a temp probe for the potatoes, he timed everything perfectly. The grill’s zone cooking made sure the burgers seared without sticking, and the aroma drew his friends in.<\/p><p>They all admired the results—not just the grill, but the moments they shared around it. For him, it was the perfect way to unwind after a week of hard work on the farm.<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_HUWN78":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/UGC-02.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"Built to Endure: How My Grill Survived the Storm","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>I gotta say I love my grill and couldn't be happier with the purchase from the start. This week we had some pretty bad storms come through, the last one literally toppled the grill over and hit the ground behind it. The left searer wing was a bit bent and the lower rear panel was bent and that's about the extent of the damage! I was able to form the lower panel back almost perfect and the searer is still usable and I was able to correct the damage enough to not really worry about it. The glass front survived impact from the 2 cast iron cooking plates inside too! Overall even more impressed with this product now. Great job on construction! - Testimonial from a Proud Grill Owner<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_hcKwcj":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/UGC-03.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"From Assembly to Inspiration: A Budding Engineer’s Journey","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>My 15-year-old son has spent most of the last 10 years helping me (his mom) build furniture, repair appliances, fix cars, and rebuild computers. He <em>loved<\/em> building this grill. My budding engineer was so impressed by the clear, easy-to-follow instructions in the manual.<\/p><p>I know most professionals don’t work for compliments from 15-year-olds, but please let your technical writers know: D learned something today that will likely shape his future career.<\/p><p>Tomorrow, Charlie takes his bachelor voyage. More gushing to follow! – A Proud Monument Grills Mom.<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_MwcnHE":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/UGC-04.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"Cooking Through the Storm: A Grandmother’s Love","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>When Hurricane Helene swept through, leaving power outages and chaos in its wake, one determined grandmother refused to let the storm disrupt a cherished tradition.<\/p><p>Her only grandchild was visiting, and breakfast wasn’t just a meal—it was a special ritual. The storm raged outside, with strong winds and relentless rain, but inside, her heart was set on making her granddaughter’s favorite breakfast: warm, golden French toast.<\/p><p>With no electricity, she turned to her trusted Monument Grill. Shielding herself from the storm under a makeshift cover, she carefully prepared each slice of bread, soaking it in the perfect mixture of eggs, milk, and cinnamon. The sizzle on the grill brought a sense of normalcy amidst the chaos.<\/p><p>As the storm howled, the delicious aroma of French toast filled the air. Her granddaughter watched in awe as her grandmother’s determination turned a tropical storm into a memory they’d both cherish forever. That morning, over plates of perfectly grilled French toast, they shared laughter, warmth, and love—a reminder that even the fiercest storms can’t dampen the power of family traditions. – A Grateful Monument Grills User<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}}},"block_order":["