Grill","review_title":"Finally, a Grill That Keeps Up","review_info":"My old two-burner couldn’t keep up when friends came over. I upgraded to the 405 and it made an instant difference. I can run multiple cooking zones now—veggies on low, steaks on high, and buns toasting on the top rack. Even heat, solid build, and just the right size—not too bulky, but with real grilling power."}},"review_7wBewr":{"type":"review","settings":{"review_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/E425-0306-1_1.jpg","review_product_title":"Eminence 425","review_product_info":"| Tech Stainless Propane Gas Grill","review_title":"Cookout Champion","review_info":"We hosted a cookout with my famaliy, and the Eminence 425 didn’t flinch. Burgers, brats, corn, skewers—all going at once. The burners heated evenly across the whole surface, and the side shelf made prep easy. My old grill would’ve struggled, but this handled it like a champ. People asked if I was a pro—just the right grill, I said."}}},"block_order":["review_jURW4d","review_KmQ3qV","review_7wBewr"],"name":"9th Anniversary Review","settings":{"reviews_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/E605--4_1.jpg"}},"logo_list_fGGknE":{"type":"logo-list","blocks":{"logo_iKrzgx":{"type":"logo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/542aa4c2d7c83660fff0b69768bc841d8dff0f6c.png","url":"","logo_width":200,"text":""}},"logo_79FE4M":{"type":"logo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/4fa35498703fd900bf079267ae45bd68e7e26cfb.png","url":"","logo_width":200,"text":""}},"logo_PWmzGb":{"type":"logo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/7b4f2cc735d664c66f4fc9ee390fc68e8707524a.png","url":"","logo_width":200,"text":""}},"logo_96wKYi":{"type":"logo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/a5f9ebaf54d4d906ecda7462fa76ec600df92542.png","url":"","logo_width":200,"text":""}},"logo_YwCtRA":{"type":"logo","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/362d96052f49fd98bddec3d605d32e298a7c5a43.png","url":"","logo_width":200,"text":""}}},"block_order"